{"c":[{"name":"20261016T011032Z-693e0a376cc1e681","text":"Cults updateCreation on h7 run 38833253910 rejected downloadPrice 0: price must be >= 0.5. Publisher sends 0 only when that argument is non-null. createBlueprint and createIllustration already ran, so destroy did not.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261016T012019Z-f21f69d0989bdb0e","text":"A free Cults listing omits downloadPrice. updateCreation treated numeric 0 as a paid price and required >= 0.5. New files are added only after that update succeeds; the previous set is removed then.","type":"note"}]}
